Wheels & Bones — licensing
==========================

Code (game.py, build scripts, tools under art_tests/, i18n_work/, docs/*.py):
  MIT License — see LICENSE-CODE.

Game content (quest texts, dialogue, translations, documentation, artwork, 3D models, music
in assets/ and docs/): Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
— see LICENSE-CONTENT.
  Attribution: "Wheels & Bones" by GOAT — Grassroots Open Assistive Tech
  (https://www.openassistivetech.org/).

Third-party:
  DejaVu fonts (assets/fonts/DejaVuSans*.ttf) — DejaVu Fonts License, see assets/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.
  Atkinson Hyperlegible font (assets/fonts/AtkinsonHyperlegible*.ttf, Braille Institute) — SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  see assets/fonts/LICENSE-AtkinsonHyperlegible-OFL.txt.
  Artwork, 3D models and music were generated with AI tools (Meshy, ChatGPT/Codex, ComfyUI with Qwen-Image, YuE)
  from the team's own references and prompts, then edited by the team; they are released under CC BY-SA 4.0 as above.
  Repair procedures and facts are based on manufacturers' service and owner's manuals collected by
  BARC — Bay Area Repair Coalition, and on the Permobil "Seating & Positioning Guide". Product and
  brand names belong to their owners and are used only to describe real equipment.
